Employment-Related Travel|Refers to any travel related to employment, and it differs from commuting to and from the workplace. It includes:
- Traveling, transporting, or accompanying goods or persons related to work, while not performing their actual work activities;

- Travel between work sites to reach field projects, fishing areas, assignments, conferences, or to meet customer demands.

